	(text "Fans 0-7: 74HCT541, fan 8: 74AHCT1G125 (same 5 V gate drive). Same MOSFET as the heaters.\nB5819W flyback per fan (cathode to FAN_RAIL). Connector: pin 1 = FAN-, pin 2 = V+.\nMax 1 A per fan, 3 A total. 2- and 3-wire fans (tacho not connected)."
